Bike stelle ich hinter das Haus weil es dort sicher ist Abends sitze ich gern vor dem Fenster und genieße die Ruhe","authoredText":"Mein Zimmer in der Großstadt ist klein, aber modern. An der Wand hängt ein Bild von einer Malerin. Auf dem Regal liegen meine Unterlagen. Heute stelle ich den Tisch an das Fenster und lege den Laptop darauf. Mein E-Bike stelle ich hinter das Haus, weil es dort sicher ist. Abends sitze ich gern vor dem Fenster und genieße die Ruhe.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Mein neues Zimmer","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"a2-14-wechselpraepositionen","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Frieda, wohin stellst du die Lampe?","speaker":"Frieda","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_014_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-14-wechselpraepositionen","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ich stelle sie neben das Bett.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_014_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-14-wechselpraepositionen","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Und wo hängt jetzt das Bild?","speaker":"Frieda","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_014_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-14-wechselpraepositionen","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Es hängt schon an der Wand, über dem Sofa.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_014_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-14-wechselpraepositionen","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-14-wechselpraepositionen","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Frieda, wohin stellst du die Lampe?","speaker":"Frieda","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_014_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-14-wechselpraepositionen","leve